<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Exercício 2 - Bresenham no WebGL</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      background: #222;
      color: #fff;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    canvas {
      border: 1px solid #777;
      image-rendering: pixelated;
      cursor: crosshair;
    }

    p {
      margin: 10px 0 0;
      text-align: center;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h2>Exercício 2 - Retas e Triângulos com Bresenham</h2>
  <canvas id="canvas" width="700" height="700">
    Seu navegador não suporta canvas.
  </canvas>
  <p>
    <strong>R</strong>: modo reta | <strong>T</strong>: modo triângulo<br>
    Botão esquerdo: 2 cliques para reta / 3 cliques para triângulo<br>
    Teclas 0-9: alterar a cor.
  </p>
  <p id="status">Modo: RETA | Cor: 0 | Cliques: 0/2</p>

  <script src="exercicio2.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
